; Interprets: RFC 7944
;; What RFC 7944's clauses state in prose about an AVP's value or presence,
;; read by hand and pinned to the sentences read (docs/constraints.md), in
;; clause order. The document defines no command: DRMP rides every
;; application's messages through their * [ AVP ].


;; The default priority is the node's, set by its local configuration
;; (section 8), not a value of the AVP.
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: drmp-absent-default-priority
; AVP: DRMP
; Section: 8
"When using DRMP information, Diameter nodes MUST use the default priority for transactions that do not have priority specified in a DRMP AVP."
    text-only
